  "body": "Minor, but as I implement [Element definition](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#element-definition) in Blink, it looks more natural to do step 8-9 (observedAttributes) together with 12-17 (connectedCallback, disconnectedCallback, and attributeChangedCallback), as:\n- 10-11 (prototype) are mandatory while 8-9 and 12-17 are optional.\n- 8-9 (observedAttributes) is related with attributeChangedCallback.\n\nDoes this order matter? Any reasons to run 8-9 (observedAttributes) before checking prototype?\n",
